  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nAccording to the question, after '-' and '÷' and numbers 2 and 6 are interchanging:\n\nOption 1) 10 ÷ 2 - 6 = 7 ⇒ 10 - 6 ÷ 2 = 7\n\n⇒ 10 - __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 7\n\n⇒ __**10 - 3**__ = 7\n\n⇒ 7 = 7 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) 6 ÷ 10 - 2 = 4 ⇒ 2 - 10 ÷ 6 = 4\n\n⇒ 2 - __**10 ÷ 6**__ = 4\n\n⇒ __**2 **____**- 1.67**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 0.33 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 2 ÷ 6 - 10 = 5 ⇒ 6 - 2 ÷ 10 = 5\n\n⇒ 6 - 2 ÷ 10 = 5\n\n⇒ 6 - 0.2 = 5\n\n⇒ 5.8 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 6 - 2 ÷ 10 = 5 ⇒ 2 ÷ 6 - 10 = 5\n\n⇒ __**2 ÷ 6**__ - 10 = 5\n\n⇒ __**0.33 -**____** 10**__ = 5\n\n⇒ -9.67 ≠ 5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
